 'label': 'list_item', 'bold': 0, 'size': 10.0, 'level': 'Body', 'path': 'AMCOR PLC | 83 Tower Road North Warmley, Bristol BS30 8XP United Kingdom | Cautionary Statement Regarding Forward-Looking Statements', 'text': '• the inability to expand our current business effectively through either organic growth, including by product innovation, or acquisitions;'}\n38 {'page': 4, 'label': 'list_item', 'bold': 0, 'size': 10.0, 'level': 'Body', 'path': 'AMCOR PLC | 83 Tower Road North Warmley, Bristol BS30 8XP United Kingdom | Cautionary Statement Regarding Forward-Looking Statements', 'text': '• challenging current and future global economic conditions, including inflation and supply chain disruptions;'}\n39 {'page': 4, 'label': 'list_item', 'bold': 0, 'size': 10.0, 'level': 'Body', 'path': 'AMCOR PLC | 83 Tower Road North Warmley, Bristol BS30 8XP United Kingdom | Cautionary Statement Regarding Forward-Looking Statements', 'text': '• impact of operating internationally, including negative impacts from the Russia-Ukraine conflict;'}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
